# DRC-PDK-1: sky130A: sky130_fd_sc_hd__inv_1 as installed, then the same cell with a deliberate met1 and li1 width violation; CAP of each.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/sky130A -noprompt
snap internal
scalegrid 1 2
drc off
drc euclidean on
snap internal
load input/sky130_fd_sc_hd__inv_1
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
drc count
box 0 0 10 300
paint met1
box 1000 0 1010 50
paint li1
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save inv_broken
